---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About · India's Pulse" activeTab="about">
  <div id="about-page">
    <div class="about-wrap">

      <section class="about-hero">
        <svg class="about-leaf" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <path d="M4 20C4 20 7 12 13 8C19 4 21 3 21 3C21 3 20 8 16 12C12 16 4 20 4 20Z"/>
        </svg>
        <h1>India's <span>Pulse</span></h1>
        <p class="about-tagline">Know what you breathe.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-card">
        <h2>What is this?</h2>
        <p>
          India's Pulse is an open air-quality dashboard that maps real-time AQI (Air Quality Index)
          data from monitoring stations across India. The map shows every state's weighted average AQI,
          with worse cities carrying more weight so the national picture stays honest.
        </p>
        <p>
          Click any state on the map — or in the side panel — to drill down into its cities and individual
          monitoring stations.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-card">
        <h2>Data Source</h2>
        <div class="about-source-row">
          <div class="about-source-icon">🏛️</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Central Pollution Control Board (CPCB)</strong>
            <p>
              All AQI readings are sourced from the CPCB's National Ambient Air Quality Monitoring (NAAQS)
              network via the Government of India's open data portal
              (<a href="https://data.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">data.gov.in</a>).
              Data is fetched live each time you load the page and covers PM2.5 and PM10 pollutants
              across hundreds of stations nationwide.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-pill-row">
          <span class="about-pill">PM2.5</span>
          <span class="about-pill">PM10</span>
          <span class="about-pill">Live CPCB feed</span>
          <span class="about-pill">api.data.gov.in</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="about-card">
        <h2>AQI Methodology</h2>
        <p>
          India's National AQI scale (0–500) is used throughout. Raw pollutant concentrations (µg/m³)
          are converted to AQI using the CPCB breakpoint tables for PM2.5 and PM10.
        </p>
        <p>
          State-level AQI is a <strong>weighted average</strong> where each city contributes
          proportionally to its own pollution level — a city at AQI 350 gets roughly ten times
          the weight of a city at AQI 35. This prevents clean rural areas from masking heavily
          polluted urban centres.
        </p>
        <div class="about-aqi-legend">
          {[
            ['Good',        '0–50',   '#55A84F'],
            ['Satisfactory','51–100', '#A3C853'],
            ['Moderate',    '101–200','#FFF833'],
            ['Poor',        '201–300','#F29C33'],
            ['Very Poor',   '301–400','#E93F33'],
            ['Severe',      '401–500','#AF2D24'],
          ].map(([label, range, color]) => (
            <div class="aqi-leg-row">
              <span class="aqi-leg-dot" style={`background:${color}`}></span>
              <span class="aqi-leg-label">{label}</span>
              <span class="aqi-leg-range">{range}</span>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="about-card">
        <h2>Tech Stack</h2>
        <div class="about-pill-row">
          <span class="about-pill">Astro 5</span>
          <span class="about-pill">Vanilla JS</span>
          <span class="about-pill">Hand-rolled SVG map</span>
          <span class="about-pill">GitHub Pages</span>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top:12px">
          The India map is an SVG rendered directly from SVGOMG-compressed state paths. No mapping
          library is used — state fills, AQI bubbles, centroids, and hit-testing are all computed
          in-browser with Canvas and vanilla DOM APIs.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-card">
        <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          Boundaries shown on the map are for <strong>representational purposes only</strong> and do
          not reflect official Survey of India (SOI) demarcations or any political assertion.
        </p>
        <p>
          AQI values are updated periodically by CPCB monitoring stations. Some stations may report
          delayed or missing data; the dashboard only displays stations with valid readings at the
          time of your visit.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  #about-page {
    position: fixed; top: var(--nav-h); left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    overflow-y: auto; padding: 32px 20px 60px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    #about-page { padding: 20px 14px 40px; }
    .about-hero { padding: 20px 0 16px; }
    .about-hero h1 { font-size: 26px; }
    .about-card { padding: 18px 18px; }
    .about-aqi-legend { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
  #about-page::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 4px; }
  #about-page::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
  #about-page::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--border); border-radius: 2px; }

  .about-wrap { max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; }

  .about-hero {
    text-align: center; padding: 32px 0 28px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  }
  .about-leaf { width: 40px; height: 40px; fill: var(--accent); }
  .about-hero h1 { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.8px; color: var(--text); }
  .about-hero h1 span { color: var(--accent); }
  .about-tagline { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); font-style: italic; letter-spacing: 0.3px; }

  .about-card {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 24px 28px; margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .about-card h2 {
    font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 12px; letter-spacing: -0.2px;
  }
  .about-card p {
    font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .about-card p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .about-card a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
  .about-card a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .about-card strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }

  .about-source-row {
    display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .about-source-icon { font-size: 24px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }
  .about-source-row strong { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text); display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .about-source-row p { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .about-pill-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
  .about-pill {
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; padding: 3px 10px;
    background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 20px; color: var(--text-muted); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  }

  .about-aqi-legend {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(160px, 1fr));
    gap: 6px; margin-top: 14px;
  }
  .aqi-leg-row {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
    background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px 10px;
  }
  .aqi-leg-dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .aqi-leg-label { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); flex: 1; }
  .aqi-leg-range { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
</style>
